WEBVTT

00:06:57.250 --> 00:07:00.682
Deshironi te bashkoheni me mua?

00:07:00.682 --> 00:07:02.345
Faleminderit.

00:07:02.345 --> 00:07:07.644
(Duartrokitje)

00:07:07.644 --> 00:07:11.100
June Cohen: Keshtu Isabel —
IA: Faleminderit.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:14.461
JC: Fillimisht,

00:07:14.461 --> 00:07:17.210
Nuk po supozoj se flas
ne emer te komunitetit te TED,

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.388
por kam deshire t'ju them
qe mendoj

00:07:19.388 --> 00:07:21.222
se te gjithe jemi ne nje mendje
se ju jeni akoma sharmante,

00:07:21.222 --> 00:07:23.191
joshese dhe seksi. PO?

00:07:23.191 --> 00:07:25.686
IA: Ahh, faleminderit.
(Duartrokitje)

00:07:25.686 --> 00:07:28.172
JC: Pa diskutim.
IA: JO, eshte make up.

00:07:28.172 --> 00:07:29.612
Moderator: Tani, do te ishte e cuditshme

00:07:29.612 --> 00:07:32.132
nese do t'ju beja disa pyetje per
fantazite e tua erotike?